  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Beyond these gates... <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200650079006F006E0064002000740068006500730065002000670061007400650073002E002E002E002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Beyond these gates, a brilliant life full of Pokémon\nawaits you!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you’re not from around here, get ready—the\nsights of Lumiose will knock your socks off!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 159
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready for some\nPokémon battles! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200072006500610064007900200066006F007200200073006F006D0065000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C006500730021002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m hoping to have some invigorating Pokémon\nbattles here in Lumiose City!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s so many cafés in Lumiose. My dad’s\ngonna take an hour just to pick where to go.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A little rest at a café would hit the spot!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020006C006900740074006C00650020007200650073007400200061007400200061002000630061006600E900200077006F0075006C006400200068006900740020007400680065002000730070006F007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When you’ve just spent 13 hours on a plane, it’s\nonly natural to feel a bit worn out...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t wait to see what kinds of Pokémon we’re\ngonna meet!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000630061006E201900740020007700610069007400200074006F0020007300650065002000770068006100740020006B0069006E006400730020006F006600200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000770065201900720065000A0067006F006E006E00610020006D00650065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You can find wild Pokémon even inside the city\nhere!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000630061006E002000660069006E0064002000770069006C006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006500760065006E00200069006E0073006900640065002000740068006500200063006900740079000A006800650072006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose City!\nWe made it! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0075006D0069006F00730065002000430069007400790021000A005700650020006D0061006400650020006900740021002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s one big travel bag. Hope you enjoy your\nvisit to Lumiose!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020006F006E00650020006200690067002000740072006100760065006C0020006200610067002E00200048006F0070006500200079006F007500200065006E006A006F007900200079006F00750072000A0076006900730069007400200074006F0020004C0075006D0069006F0073006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve heard Lumiose has changed a lot lately. I’m\nhoping to find out more about that.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose has more than history—it’s got ambition,\ntoo. They’re always trying new things here!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve arrived, Lumiose!\nGimme a “bienvenue!” <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004920190076006500200061007200720069007600650064002C0020004C0075006D0069006F007300650021000A00470069006D006D0065002000610020201C006200690065006E00760065006E007500650021201D002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll cherish everything you’ve got to offer,\nLumiose! You’ll be glad I’m here!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Think I’ll drop my bags at\nthe hotel, then take a stroll.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069006E006B002000492019006C006C002000640072006F00700020006D007900200062006100670073002000610074000A00740068006500200068006F00740065006C002C0020007400680065006E002000740061006B0065002000610020007300740072006F006C006C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It was just so...Kalos! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400200077006100730020006A00750073007400200073006F002E002E002E004B0061006C006F00730021002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The view out the train window was spectacular! It\nwas like the very essence of the Kalos region!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The airport was farther from the city than you’d\nexpect, huh?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500200061006900720070006F00720074002000770061007300200066006100720074006800650072002000660072006F006D0020007400680065002000630069007400790020007400680061006E00200079006F007520190064000A006500780070006500630074002C0020006800750068003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can travel all by myself!\n’Specially with my Pokémon!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000630061006E002000740072006100760065006C00200061006C006C0020006200790020006D007900730065006C00660021000A2019005300700065006300690061006C006C0079002000770069007400680020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
